<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>GoodBulk Ltd. (N-OTC: BULK) Announces Share Transfer And Director Resignation</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2024-08-16 17:15:28</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Hamilton, Bermuda (16 August 2024). Lantern Capital Partners has, on 6 August 2024, sold their shareholding of 3,664,121 common shares in GoodBulk Ltd. (the "Company") (N-OTC: BULK), representing 13.5% of the issued and outstanding common shares in the Company, to Bretta Navigation Corporation, a company wholly owned by John Michael Radziwill, the Company's President and Director. Consequently, Mr. Radziwill directly and indirectly owns 14,427,216 common shares in the Company, representing 53.3% of the issued and outstanding common shares in the Company. <br>Following the sale, Lantern Capital Partners does not hold any shares in the Company. As a consequence, Andy Mitchell has resigned from his position as director in the Company.<br>* * *<br>Company contact:<br>John Michael Radziwill<br>CEO and Chairman<br>GoodBulk Ltd. <br>Tel.: + 377 97 98 59 87<br>Email: jmradziwill@goodbulk.com</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://goodbulk.com/">
https://goodbulk.com/</a>
<a href="/public/news/21482.pdf">
