<td colspan="3"><p>Hamilton, Bermuda – (8 February 2024) - GoodBulk Ltd. (the "Company") (N-OTC: BULK) has on 8 February 2024 announced that the Board of Directors yesterday, 7 February 2024, authorized a payment out of the contributed surplus of $0.11 per common share (SNDR (as defined below)) payable to all SNDR holders of record as of 12 February 2024 and payable on 22 February 2024. <br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>John Michael Radziwill <br>CEO and Chairman<br>GoodBulk Ltd. <br>Tel +377 97 98 59 87 <br>Email: jmradziwill@goodbulk.com</p></td>
