</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Hamilton, Bermuda - (13 September 2018) - GoodBulk Ltd. ("GoodBulk" or the "Company") today announces that Lantern Capital Partners has sold 154,062 common shares in the Company on 7 September 2018 at a price of USD 16.99 per common share. Milos Brajovic, who is a member of the board of the Company, is the co-founder and partner of Lantern Capital Partners. <br> <br>Following the sale, Lantern Capital Partners holds 3,664,121 common shares in GoodBulk, representing 12.16651% of the issued common shares in GoodBulk. <br><br>Company Contact<br>Andrew Garcia<br>President and Director<br>GoodBulk Ltd.<br>Tel 	+377 97 98 59 87<br>Email	ag@goodbulk.com</p></td>
