<td><h2>GOODBULK LTD (BULK NS) – DUTCH ACTION COMPLETED</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2018-09-10 15:05:02</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NOT FOR RELEASE, PUBLICATION OR DISTRIBUTION, IN WHOLE OR IN PART, DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY, IN OR INTO THE UNITED STATES, CANADA, AUSTRALIA, HONG KONG OR JAPAN, OR ANY OTHER JURISDICTION IN WHICH THE RELEASE, PUBLICATION OR DISTRIBUTION WOULD BE UNLAWFUL OR WOULD REQUIRE REGISTRATION OR OTHER MEASURES. THIS ANNOUNCEMENT DOES NOT CONSTITUTE AN OFFER OF ANY OF THE SECURITIES DESCRIBED HEREIN.<br><br>Oslo– (10 September 2018) –Reference is made to the press release dated 7 September 2018 relating to a buy order received by Clarksons Platou Securities AS (“CPS”) to buy up to approximately USD 22 million worth of shares in GoodBulk. The Dutch auction resulted in 1,294,879 shares being crossed by CPS at USD 16.99 per share (approximately NOK 143.22).</p></td>
</tr>
