<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>GOODBULK LTD (BULK NS) - CLARKSONS PLATOU SECURITIES AS RECEIVES ORDER TO BUY UP TO USD 22 MILLION WORTH OF SHARES IN GOODBULK</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2018-09-07 07:59:05</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NOT FOR RELEASE, PUBLICATION OR DISTRIBUTION, IN WHOLE OR IN PART, DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY, IN OR INTO THE UNITED STATES, CANADA, AUSTRALIA, HONG KONG OR JAPAN, OR ANY OTHER JURISDICTION IN WHICH THE RELEASE, PUBLICATION OR DISTRIBUTION WOULD BE UNLAWFUL OR WOULD REQUIRE REGISTRATION OR OTHER MEASURES. THIS ANNOUNCEMENT DOES NOT CONSTITUTE AN OFFER OF ANY OF THE SECURITIES DESCRIBED HEREIN.<br><br>Oslo– (7 September 2018) –Clarksons Platou Securities AS (“CPS”) has received from an undisclosed purchaser an order to buy up to approximately USD 22 million worth of shares in GoodBulk.<br><br>The purchase will take place as a Dutch Auction with a price range from USD 15.50 to USD 17.50 per share (constituting approximately NOK 130.00 to NOK 147.00). All purchases will be purchased at the same price per share.<br><br>The Dutch Auction will commence at 09:00 CET on 7 September and close at 16:30 CET on 7 September, however it may close at 12:00 CET at the discretion of CPS in the event the purchaser accepts the price. The offer comprises a minimum of 1,250,000 shares and a maximum of 1,420,000 shares in GoodBulk which constitutes approximately 4.2% to 4.8% of the outstanding GoodBulk shares.<br><br>Potential sellers may contact CPS at e-mail: goodbulk@clarksons.com or by phone +47 22 01 63 01.</p></td>
</tr>
