<td><h2>GoodBulk Ltd. (N-OTC: BULK) Announces Written Resolution in lieu for formal members' annual general meeting - EXTENSION OF DEADLINE FOR SUBMITTING INSTRUCTIONS</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2018-05-02 10:04:03</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>GoodBulk Ltd. (the "Company") encourages all shareholders to approve the written resolution relating to certain matters to the combined 2017 and 2018 annual general meeting by signing the instruction to DNB Bank ASA in its capacity as holder of the legal interests in the shares. Kindly note that the original deadline for submitting instructions to DNB Bank ASA has been extended to Thursday 3 May 2018 at 12:00 CET. Please send the instructions to:<br><br>DNB Bank ASA<br>Registrars Dept.<br>P.O. Box 1600 Sentrum<br>0021 Oslo<br>Norway<br><br>or by e-mail: vote@dnb.no<br><br>The proposed written resolution includes, amongst others, noting receipt of the financial statements and the auditor's report thereon, the appointment of certain directors and appointment of Deloitte Certified Public Accountants S.A. as the Company's auditor and authorisation of the directors of the Company to determine the auditor's fee, as further described in the written resolution. The written resolution, along with a cover letter and instruction form has been sent to all shareholders and may also be obtained by contacting DNB Bank ASA at sten.sundby@dnb.no / +47 23 26 80 30. <br><br>About GoodBulk Ltd.<br>GoodBulk, incorporated in Bermuda and headquartered in Monaco, is an owner and operator of dry bulk vessels founded in October 2016 for the purpose of owning high quality second hand dry bulk vessels between 50,000 - 210,000 DWT. Upon delivery of announced vessel acquisitions GoodBulk will control a fleet of 25 dry bulk vessels, including 22 Capesize vessels, 1 Panamax vessel, and 2 Supramax vessels. Designed to provide an efficient platform for investors to access the dry bulk market, all assets are externally managed by C Transport Maritime S.A.M. a leading third-party manager of dry bulk vessels. GoodBulk is listed on the Norwegian OTC market under the symbol BULK. More information can be found online at www.goodbulk.com.<br><br>Company contact:<br>Andrew Garcia <br>President and Director<br>GoodBulk Ltd.<br>+377 97 98 59 87<br>ag@goodbulk.com</p></td>
</tr>
