<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Hamilton, Bermuda - (November 9, 2017) - GoodBulk Ltd. ("GoodBulk" or the "Company") (N-OTC: BULK) a recently formed owner and operator of dry bulk vessels today announced its financial results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2017. <br><br>This press release is available in full on the GoodBulk website and the results can be found on this link https://goodbulk.com/financial-reports/.</p></td>
